    "## Configuration\n",
    "Model, LoRA, and training hyperparameters. `fp16` (not `bf16`) matters here -- a Kaggle T4 is a Turing GPU (compute capability 7.5); bf16 tensor cores only exist from Ampere (cc 8.0) onward, so bf16 either silently falls back to slow emulated math or mismatches the Trainer's mixed-precision mode. See the project README for full sizing rationale."
